      },
      {
        "sid": "BOOK_013_6",
        "book_id_anon": "BOOK_013",
        "cell": "CELL_C",
        "sentence": "With the danger behind them, the cyborgs returned to their usual carefree bantering, some scowling, some smiling, but all together, all individuals and yet part of a family.",
